stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RouteLoading
  RouteLoading --> Login: no valid stored token
  RouteLoading --> Workspace: restore unexpired stored JWT
  Login --> Authenticating: submit required credentials
  Authenticating --> LoginError: login rejects or network fails
  LoginError --> Authenticating: resubmit
  Authenticating --> Workspace: token received
  Workspace --> Login: sign out or token expiry
  Workspace --> Login: protected API 401 / session-expired event
  state Workspace {
    [*] --> Overview
    Overview --> AuditEditing: navigate to cloud audit
    AuditEditing --> ValidationError: no services or region unconfirmed
    ValidationError --> AuditEditing: edit selection or accept region
    AuditEditing --> Processing: submit with selection and accepted region
    Processing --> AuditError: request rejects
    AuditError --> Processing: resubmit valid form
    Processing --> ResponseReady: full response received
    ResponseReady --> ReportLoading: navigate to persisted report
    ReportLoading --> ReportReady: assessment loaded
    ReportLoading --> ReportError: API rejects
    ReportError --> ReportLoading: Try again
  }
  note right of Processing
    Sequential backend agents; no streamed per-agent progress.
    Overlay makes root inert until response.
  end note
